												'SipName'         => $registrarHost,
												'RegisterAddr'    => $registrarHost,
												'RegisterUser'    => $parameters["username"],
												'RegisterPswd'    => $vExtension->password,
												'DHCPHostname'    => $macModels[$x],
											];

											$this->updateXmlValues($xmlObject, $xmlUpdates);
											$finalXml = $xmlObject->asXML();
											$provisionKey = "provision:fanvil:{$cleanMac}:xml:" . $parameters["username"];
											$this->redis->set($provisionKey, $finalXml);
										}
										elseif ($macBrands[$x] == 'snom') {
											libxml_use_internal_errors(true);
											$xmlObject = simplexml_load_string($contentTemplate);
											if ($xmlObject === false) {
												return $this->response->setJsonContent([
													"result" => "error",
													"message" => "Invalid XML format in textConfig",
													"debug" => libxml_get_errors()
												]);
											}

											$xmlUpdates = [
												'setting_server'    => "{$provisionBase}",
												'user_realname'     => $parameters["extension"] . " | " . ($parameters["firstname"] . ' ' . $parameters["lastname"] ?? "User"),
												'user_name'         => $parameters["username"],
												'user_host'         => $registrarHost . ':5060',
												'user_pass'         => $vExtension->password,
												'timezone'			=> $macTimezones[$x],
												'stun_server'		=> $macStuns[$x]
											];

											$this->updateXmlValues($xmlObject, $xmlUpdates);
											$this->applyRouterPhoneXml($xmlObject, $routerTunnelId, $provisionBase, $cleanMac);
											$finalXml = $xmlObject->asXML();
											$provisionKey = "provision:snom:{$cleanMac}:xml:" . $parameters["username"];
											$this->redis->set($provisionKey, $finalXml); 
										}
										elseif ($macBrands[$x] == 'grandstream') {
											// Ensure we have a valid template before proceeding
											if (empty($contentTemplate)) {
												// Try fetching with exact model name (case-insensitive fallback)
												$modelVariants = [
													$macModels[$x],
													strtoupper($macModels[$x]),
													strtolower($macModels[$x]),
												];
												foreach ($modelVariants as $variant) {
													$fallbackKey = 'provision:grandstream:' . str_replace(' ', '', $variant);
													$contentTemplate = $this->redis->hGet($fallbackKey, "value");
													if (!empty($contentTemplate)) {
														break;
													}
												}
											}

											$cfgUpdates = [
												"P47"     => $registrarHost,
												"P35"     => $parameters["username"],
												"P36"     => $parameters["username"],
												"P34"     => $vExtension->password,
												"P3"      => $parameters["extension"]
											];

											if (!empty($contentTemplate)) {
												foreach ($cfgUpdates as $key => $value) {
													$pattern = '/^(' . preg_quote($key, '/') . ')\s*=.*$/m';
													if (preg_match($pattern, $contentTemplate)) {
														$contentTemplate = preg_replace($pattern, "$1=$value", $contentTemplate);
													} else {
														$contentTemplate .= "\n{$key}={$value}";
													}
												}
											} else {
												// No template found — build minimal config as last resort
												$contentTemplate = "";
												foreach ($cfgUpdates as $key => $value) {
													$contentTemplate .= "{$key}={$value}\n";
												}
												$contentTemplate = trim($contentTemplate);
											}

											$provisionKey = "provision:grandstream:{$cleanMac}:xml:" . $parameters["username"]; 
											$this->redis->set($provisionKey, $contentTemplate);
										}
										elseif ($macBrands[$x] == 'custom') {
											$phoneTemplate = PhoneTemplates::findFirstById($macTemplateIds[$x]);

											if (!$phoneTemplate) {
